subtrack (subtrack v{VERSION})

Manage subscription suggestions

USAGE:
  subtrack [COMMANDS] <OPTIONS>

COMMANDS:
  [suggest] <OPTIONS>       Manage subscription suggestions
  add <OPTIONS>             Add a suggestion as a subscription (non-interactive)
  dismiss <OPTIONS>         Dismiss a suggestion
  list <OPTIONS>            List pending suggestions
  view <OPTIONS>            View full details of a suggestion

For more info, run any command with the `--help` flag:
  subtrack suggest --help
  subtrack suggest add --help
  subtrack suggest dismiss --help
  subtrack suggest list --help
  subtrack suggest view --help

OPTIONS:
  -h, --help             Display this help message
  -v, --version          Display this version

